		{
			dependencies: ["72D090FF4C44DAAD"]
			description: [
				"This is a &5fragile&r world. From the moment you arrived here, you realized that it is far more fragile than the one you once knew."
				""
				"To begin your journey, you will still need to start from the &6First Tree&r and gradually develop step by step."
				""
				"As for what the previous world was like—who knows?"
			]
