		{
			dependencies: ["040207B33E2FEBFF"]
			description: [
				"Obtaining a stone pickaxe usually marks the start of a repetitive mining process.  "
				""
				"But don't be in a hurry just yet! Why not take a look at the subsequent tasks? Perhaps in this modpack, there are various &6unexpected&r ways to obtain the resources you crave!"
			]
			id: "0721AF9D7D5E4A7C"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 16
