						Damage: 0
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "A Perfect Start"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 11.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3E9DD0B78886A183"]
			description: [
				"In this fragile world, it seems all creatures have become different. You have found a new way to survive—&2opening the chest and removing the heart&r！ "
				""
				"The first &5important item&r of this modpack makes its debut. From now on, you may need to carry the &2Chest Opener&r at all times.  "
				""
				"Right-click the air with the Chest Opener to open your own chest cavity and modify your internal organs.  "
				""
				"Similarly, you can right-click other creatures to open their chests—but please note, opening a chest requires the target's health to be low enough. It doesn't mean any creature can be opened from the start！"
				""
				"Please do not change the organs in your chest cavity at will; you do so at your own risk!"
			]
			id: "50CE3ADF8E4D6426"
			rewards: [{
				id: "243324C3D642D9D8"
				item: {
					Count: 1b
					id: "lightmanscurrency:coin_iron"
					tag: { }
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Open your &4heart&r and understand yourself"
			tasks: [{
				id: "368F2531CF74A900"
				item: "chestcavity:chest_opener"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Knowing Yourself"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 3.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6069FC5CA00481CE"]
			description: [
				"The &2Ore Lung&r is likely the only &6advanced organ&r you can access in the early game. &2Right-click sand with a lung in hand to obtain it&r. You can use the R key in EMI to view the methods to obtain most of the special organs."
				""
				"Advanced organs refer to a series of organs that provide &6special effects&r."
				""
				"The &2Ore Lung&r allows you to accumulate mineral dust when you mine &2stone&r blocks. Once enough dust has been accumulated, it will grant you mineral fragments based on your current Luck value."
				""
				"Please note that this resource can only be accumulated by &2breaking stone blocks&r."
			]
			icon: "kubejs:ore_lung"
			id: "2DD73A2CCC0054D8"
			rewards: [{
				count: 5
				id: "0905D2943CB40EB0"
				item: {
					Count: 1b
					id: "lightmanscurrency:coin_iron"
					tag: { }
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Inhale ore dust, accumulate minerals"
			tasks: [{
				id: "41C666877A44FFB2"
				item: "kubejs:ore_lung"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Ore Lungs"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["50CE3ADF8E4D6426"]
			description: [
				"You can try adding new organs into your own chest cavity. Different organs provide different base attributes."
				""
				"For example, hearts: the more hearts you have, the more health you will typically gain."
				""
				"However, not all organs provide &2positive effects&r. Some organs—especially those with special effects—may even have negative base attributes."
				""
				"Please note! Attributes such as &2Health, Neural Efficiency, and Detox&r affect whether a player can survive properly! When removing related organs, make sure to prepare &cemergency measures&r to avoid falling into an &cunending death loop&r!"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"However, when adding organs, you should note that organs that do not belong to you will cause &crejection&r."
				""
				"There are many ways to eliminate organ rejection, and using &6Healing Additive&r is one of the most cost-effective solutions. Hold the Healing Essence in your off-hand and the incompatible organ in your main hand to remove its ownership, thereby resolving organ rejection."
				""
				"Alternatively, you can also craft the organ and the Healing Additive together in a crafting table to remove rejection. (This method is often used for organs that can be eaten.)"
			]
			icon: "chestcavity:heart"
			id: "6069FC5CA00481CE"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "02FFBC5A74481DDF"
					item: "chestcavity:heart"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 4
					id: "7CD3471551081AE6"
					item: "biomancy:healing_additive"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "783C0CA0E2FDDBFB"
					item: {
						Count: 1b
						id: "wares:delivery_agreement"
						tag: {
							buyerAddress: "{\"color\":\"#333333\",\"text\":\"\"}"
							buyerName: "{\"color\":\"#7f8584\",\"text\":\"黑市酿造师\"}"
							id: "potion"
							message: "{\"color\":\"#333333\",\"text\":\"我这里. . .有无穷尽的治愈原液。\\n不过价格嘛. . .\"}"
							paymentItems: [{
								Count: 1
								id: "biomancy:healing_additive"
							}]
							requestedItems: [{
								Count: 8
