				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Redefine Your Inneer Self"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 3.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6069FC5CA00481CE"]
			description: [
				"&aHealth : &rAffects your &emaximum health&r. When it is negative, you will continuously lose health."
				""
				"&aStrength : &rAffects your &eattack damage&r and &emovement speed&r."
				""
				"&aSpeed : &rAffects your &emovement speed&r."
				""
				"&aDefense : &rReduces incoming damage."
				""
				"&aNerves : &rAffects your &emining speed&r and &emovement speed&r. Negative nerves will prevent you from moving."
				""
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&bBreath Recovery : &rAffects the &erecovery rate of oxygen&r."
				""
				"&bBreath Capacity : &rAffects your &emaximum oxygen capacity&r. Low breath capacity will cause oxygen depletion during strenuous activity."
				""
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&6Endurance : &rAffects the &econsumption rate of hunger and saturation&r."
				""
				"&6Digestion : &rAffects the amount of &ehunger restored&r from food."
				""
				"&6Nutriton : &rAffects the &esaturation value&r of food."
				""
				"&6Metabolism : &rAffects how fast health is restored from saturation."
				""
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&dFiltration : &rWithout sufficient filtration, you will be poisoned."
				""
				"&dDetoxification : &rAffects the duration of negative status effects on yourself."
				""
				"&dLuck : &rAffects loot tables and certain skill effects."
			]
			icon: "chestcavity:golem_cable"
			id: "5BC3743958DA4B16"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "68FEB532C449F1F0"
