				"The main purpose of going to a Nether Fortress is to obtain Blaze Rods, which can be crafted into Blaze Powder to progress toward The End."
				""
				"Of course, there is also an alternative method through Piglin bartering to obtain Blaze Powder, but this is not recommended."
				""
