		{
			dependencies: ["3E9DD0B78886A183"]
			description: [
				"&dCreate&r will bring you the following:"
				""
				"1.Some convenient machines that can &eautomatically obtain&r large amounts of natural resources."
				""
				"2.Some visually impressive machines that can perform certain meaningless tasks in a very stylish way."
				""
				"3.Certain progression that &emust&r be completed using Create machines."
				""
				"&2Considering that some players may not fully understand or may not want to engage deeply with Create, this modpack does not heavily lean toward automation in its design.&r Except for a few challenge-related organs, Create is also an &eoptional component&r."
				""
				"Therefore, &cyou do not need to go out of your way to master Create. Simply follow the tutorials in the &bCreate section&r on the left side of the FTB interface and complete them step by step.&r"
			]
