		{
			dependencies: ["3E9DD0B78886A183"]
			description: [
				"In the &2accessory slot&r of the inventory screen (opened by clicking the button at the top-right of the character UI), you can equip a &2lantern on belt slot&r to provide a constant dynamic light source."
				""
				"In addition, the accessory slots can be used to equip a wide variety of trinkets that significantly enhance your abilities. To obtain more useful accessories, you can craft &5Mystery Trinkets&r to receive random accessories."
				""
				"&3If you do not see the accessory in your inventory after opening a Mystery Trinket, it may have been automatically equipped in your accessory slots.&r"
			]
