			dependencies: ["3E9DD0B78886A183"]
			description: [
				"In gameplay, you will often encounter situations where you need to store large quantities of the same item. In such cases, you can consider using &2Drawers&r for bulk item storage."
				""
				"Storage Drawers are extremely useful throughout all stages of the game. Later on, you can enhance their convenience by adding a &2Drawer Controller&r to expand their storage capabilities."
				""
				"You can also integrate them with Tom’s simple storage system in the later stages, eliminating the need to manually transfer items."
