		{
			dependencies: ["040207B33E2FEBFF"]
			description: [
				"After obtaining coins from quests, the first question is how to spend them. The answer is simple — through Wares’ &6Trading System&r."
				""
				"You can find Wares’ &6Delivery Agreements&r in certain dungeon chests (&eoften found in village chests&r), which contain various types of trades."
				""
				"1. "
				"By using a &6Delivery Table&r, you can complete delivery agreements. (In the Delivery Table: place the &2Delivery Agreementt&r at the top, the &eitems to submit&r on the left, and a &6cardboard box&r at the bottom.)"
				""
				"2."
				"The &6Delivery Table&r can also function as a &2villager workstation block&r, introducing a new villager profession: &ePackager&r."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Some details:"
				""
				"1."
				"The Packager will automatically package and deliver parcels, but he will not work continuously throughout the day."
				""
				"2."
				"The Packager gains experience and levels up by delivering parcels. Higher profession levels allow him to deliver more parcels at once."
				""
				"3."
				"Players can also manually trade parcels, but the delivery cycle is longer and only one parcel can be processed at a time."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			icon: "wares:delivery_table"
			id: "74F1E7C9FB0D08A1"
			rewards: [{
