		{
			dependencies: ["3E9DD0B78886A183"]
			description: [
				"Whether you are using Tom’s Simple Storage or building in your daily gameplay, you may encounter situations where a single storage unit does not provide enough capacity. By using &2higher-tier metal barrels&r, you can gain more storage options, and they are also ideal for constructing stacked Tom storage warehouses."
				""
				"Compared to using large numbers of chests or sophisticated backpacks, barrels can significantly reduce the client’s rendering load in that area, thereby improving your game’s frame rate!"
