		{
			dependencies: ["50CE3ADF8E4D6426"]
			description: [
				"To further develop the art of &6Organ&r, you will need a stable and efficient source of organs. The &dFlesh Blob&r from Biomancy can meet this requirement."
				""
				"Flesh Blobs are a highly efficient source of organs, providing a variety of &dtemplate organs&r. These template organs have a wide range of uses, including being upgraded to Tier 3 organs when placed in an organ container, or being used to craft large quantities of advanced organs."
				""
				"To progress in Biomancy, you will need to obtain &6Sharp Fangs&r in order to craft a &6Primodial Cradle&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To find out how to obtain items such as Sharp Fangs, you can search for them in the search bar at the bottom-right corner of your &einventory screen&r. Press &6Ctrl&r to view the list of corresponding mobs that drop them."
				""
				"&7For example, the Sharp Fangs mentioned above can be obtained from creatures such as wolves and cats.&r"
			]
			id: "1884740B0724DE70"
			rewards: [{
