		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1884740B0724DE70"]
			description: [
				"The &dFlesh Blob&r is the starting point of the mod *Biomancy*. To cultivate a Flesh Blob, you need to place &esome raw meat&r into a &6Primodial Cradle&r and use a &6Potion of Healing&r. When the &deyes on the sideof the &6Primodial Cradle&r are fully lit&r, it means a Flesh Blob can be produced."
				""
				"Any type of Flesh Blob can be opened with a &6Chest Opener&r to extract its &dtemplate organs&r, which will become extremely useful later on."
				""
				"Additionally, killing a Flesh Blob will yield &dLiving Flesh&r, a type of &ebasic material&r that is widely used in later progression."
				""
				"&4Warning: If you accidentally right-click the Primodial Cradle while holding an item, it will be consumed and cannot be retrieved. Therefore, it is strongly recommended to keep the Primodial Cradle far away from your living area!!!!!!&r"
				""
				"&8There are multiple types of Flesh Blobs, each with different behaviors. Some may actively attack nearby entities, but this is not particularly important to you.&r"
			]
			id: "145730691E558B78"
			rewards: [{
