		{
			dependencies: ["145730691E558B78"]
			description: [
				"Through the Bio-Forge, you can craft a variety of unusual devices—such as the &6Bio-Lab&r mentioned later, which serves as an important tool for producing anti-rejection substances."
				""
				"In addition, the Bio-Forge can also &2directly produce template organs&r. Organs created in this way do not originate from any specific entity, meaning they &2do not trigger rejection reactions&r, making them ideal as temporary substitutes."
				""
				"&7It is also widely used in the production of basic materials for Biomancy, saving you the trouble of searching everywhere for material.&r"
