			dependencies: ["36D9ACF35A9BD9FA"]
			description: [
				"As your progress, you will notice that most special organs and activated organs have relatively poor base stats, and most cannot be further modified in later crafting processes."
				""
				"To address this, you will need to continuously improve the quality of other organs. Using an &6Organ Container&r, you can store any organ inside it, and &2some organs will reveal growth objectives&r."
