				"The Bio-Lab can be used to brew a series of special potions. Among them is a particularly important item for this modpack, namely &6Healing Essence&r."
				""
				"By holding the Healing Additive in your off-hand and an unadapted organ in your main hand, you can perform a rejection-removal process. After this process, the organ’s ownership will be cleared. This is a relatively economical method compared to the alternative enchantment-based approach."
