		{
			dependencies: ["27AE075BC0F4376A"]
			description: [
				"By now, you should have realized that most organs directly taken from creatures cannot be used immediately."
				""
				"When you equip organs from other living beings, you will suffer from &2Organ rejection&r, which will periodically deal damage over time."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"To resolve rejection, you have three possible methods:"
				""
				"1."
				"Enchant the organ with the &6O-Negative Enchantment&r to eliminate rejection. At level 2, it can even prevents organ loss."
				""
				"2."
				"Use anti-rejection substances, such as &6Healing Additive&r, to remove the organ’s binding."
				""
				"3."
				"Abandon the use of low-tier organs entirely and switch to crafted &6advanced organs&r."
				""
				""
				"&2At the current stage, using Healing Additive is the most economical and effective solution.&r"
			]
			icon: "biomancy:healing_additive"
			id: "7F0C1FA54DD6E9BC"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "4423AE850CC5D15B"
