		{
			dependencies: ["7F0C1FA54DD6E9BC"]
			description: [
				"Once you are able to freely use organs from other beings, various advanced organs will become your new goal."
				""
				"In the &5Chest cavity : Organ Guide&r chapter, you can learn about all currently added advanced organs and their related effects."
				""
				"During the process of crafting advanced organs, you will notice two special attributes:"
				""
				"1.&2Activation Attribute (Ctrl)&r: While having this organ equipped, consuming an activation pill will grant additional attributes."
				""
				"2.&2Special Effect (Alt)&r: While having this organ equipped, certain conditions can trigger special effects. For example, the early-game Ore Lung is an organ that possesses such a special effect."
				""
				"To ensure stable activation of these effects, you will need to &2mass-produce Activation Pills&r."
			]
			icon: "kubejs:active_pill"
			id: "658FEA8E308D741C"
			rewards: [{
				id: "042CB92A1CFDA391"
				item: "kubejs:active_pill"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Essential components of specific organ"
