			title: "Activation Pill"
			x: 15.25d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["658FEA8E308D741C"]
			description: [
				"Due to activation effects are widely found across organs, using an activation pill every time after modification is clearly not cost-effective."
				""
				"Therefore, when you are certain that an activation state is required, you can craft a &6Permanant Activation Pill&r. The Permanant Activation Pill can &2automatically trigger the activation state&r each time you modify an organ."
				""
				"However, it is worth noting that not all organ activation effects are beneficial, and the Pill itself is not an organ with positive effects."
				""
				"Later on, you will be able to further process it to reverse its harmful properties."
			]
			id: "50D70D990312BC70"
			rewards: [{
