		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6069FC5CA00481CE"]
			description: [
				"You will notice that, like many other adventure packs and “kitchen sink” modpacks, this modpack includes &2Alex's Mobs&r to enrich the world—but is that all?"
				""
				"All creatures possess unique &5organs&r that ensure their survival and reproduction in the world. As players, we can naturally learn from these creatures’ traits and make use of them."
				""
				"By seeking out different creatures, extracting their organs, and processing them, players can become stronger. Many advanced organs in the late game are ultimately derived from modifications of these basic biological organs."
