				"&d“Ice and Fire”&r is a &dfantasy adventure mod&r centered around &edragons&r and themed on &emythical creatures&r."
				""
				"In the game, players will encounter a wide variety of legendary beings from myth. By collecting &6manuscripts&r and compiling the &6“Bestiary”&r, you can gain knowledge about these creatures—learning to exploit their weaknesses, defeat them, harvest valuable materials from their bodies to craft equipment, loot the treasures in their lairs, and even tame some of the more docile ones as &epets&r or &emounts&r."
